" style=\"left:23.076923076923077%;top:50%\"></span><span data-current=\"false\" data-discovered=\"false\" class=\"voxel-sandbox-module__yDWSbq__radarNode\" style=\"left:76.92307692307693%;top:50%\"></span><span data-current=\"false\" data-discovered=\"false\" class=\"voxel-sandbox-module__yDWSbq__radarNode\" style=\"left:69.23076923076923%;top:69.23076923076923%\"></span><span data-current=\"false\" data-discovered=\"false\" class=\"voxel-sandbox-module__yDWSbq__radarNode\" style=\"left:30.76923076923077%;top:69.23076923076923%\"></span><span data-current=\"false\" data-discovered=\"false\" class=\"voxel-sandbox-module__yDWSbq__radarNode\" style=\"left:50%;top:19.230769230769226%\"></span><span class=\"voxel-sandbox-module__yDWSbq__radarPlayer\" style=\"left:50%;top:50%\"></span></div><p>00<!-- --> / <!-- -->08</p></aside><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"voxel-sandbox-module__yDWSbq__crosshair\"></div><div class=\"voxel-sandbox-module__yDWSbq__enterLayer\"><div class=\"voxel-sandbox-module__yDWSbq__enterPanel\"><div class=\"voxel-sandbox-module__yDWSbq__enterLead\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"voxel-sandbox-module__yDWSbq__enterMark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16Z\"></path><path d=\"m3.3 7 8.7 5 8.7-5\"></path><path d=\"M12 22V12\"></path></svg></span><div><p class=\"voxel-sandbox-module__yDWSbq__enterIndex\">06 SHIPPED / 08 LANDMARKS</p><h2 class=\"voxel-sandbox-module__yDWSbq__enterTitle\">JACK INTO PORTFOLIO CITY</h2></div></div><p class=\"voxel-sandbox-module__yDWSbq__enterMood\">Night City never sees dawn. Six shipped systems stand as neon data fortresses — walk the streets and the signals stay hot in the rain.</p><p class=\"voxel-sandbox-module__yDWSbq__controlsLine\">WASD Move · Space Jump · Shift Sprint · F Fly · E Interact · M Index · 1-8 Blocks · P Pause</p><div class=\"voxel-sandbox-module__yDWSbq__capabilityStrip\" aria-label=\"Capabilities\"><div><strong>Data analysis and modelling</strong><span>R · Python · SQL · pandas · data.table · ggplot2 · Statistical modelling</span></div><div><strong>Product and frontend</strong><span>React · Next.js · TypeScript · UX · Three.js</span></div><div><strong>Edge and data engineering</strong><span>Cloudflare · D1 · R2 · Supabase · Hono · SQL</span></div><div><strong>Research and AI</strong><span>Evidence pipelines · Agents · DCF · Open-data analysis</span></div></div><button type=\"button\" disabled=\"\" class=\"voxel-sandbox-module__yDWSbq__enterButton\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-play\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z\"></path></svg> <!-- -->Generating world</button></div></div><div class=\"voxel-sandbox-module__yDWSbq__bottomHud\"><p class=\"voxel-sandbox-module__yDWSbq__statusLine\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg> <!-- -->Locate a portfolio beacon / Turf</p>